WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,360
If one day

2
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:11,420
There is a person in this world

3
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,460
Can disturb my mood

4
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,440
I'll get to know him personally

5
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:18,160
You must not have weaknesses

6
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:21,080
To kill the enemy with your own hands

7
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,480
Why does he always stir up my emotions so easily?

8
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,940
Why is he moaning in pain?

9
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,700
Makes me want to step forward uncontrollably

10
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:37,380
I've exhausted all my strength

11
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:40,510
I won't be affected by him anymore

12
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:43,970
It's not unusual for him to go to the hospital in the middle of the night

13
00:00:44,170 --> 00:00:56,500
I never thought of saying it. Wake up soon. Hey, wake up soon.

14
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,780
until when will you sleep
